WEBVTT

00:14:28.121 --> 00:14:30.579
who'd found it within himself
to be kind to me.

00:14:31.204 --> 00:14:32.829
With a nod to Jewish custom,

00:14:32.871 --> 00:14:35.912
he told me that I should live
to be 120 years old.

00:14:36.496 --> 00:14:38.371
But it was hard for me to relate to one

00:14:38.371 --> 00:14:41.954
who had so completely washed his hands
of his own calamitous doing,

00:14:41.954 --> 00:14:45.662
to one whose life was so unexamined

00:14:45.662 --> 00:14:49.871
that he said he thought
two people had died in the crash.

00:14:53.537 --> 00:14:55.912
There was much I wished to say to Abed.

00:14:56.871 --> 00:15:00.621
I wished to tell him that,
were he to acknowledge my disability,